  _title: Centro Cultural
  _titleEn: Cultural Center
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Centros culturais oferecem arte, esporte e conviv\xEAncia gratuitos
    e viram ponto de encontro do bairro."
  _summaryEn: Cultural centers offer free art, sport and social life and become the
    neighborhood's meeting point.
  _realWorld: "O Sesc Pompeia, em S\xE3o Paulo, projetado por Lina Bo Bardi numa
    antiga f\xE1brica, \xE9 um dos centros culturais mais usados e estudados do pa\xEDs."
  _realWorldEn: "Sesc Pompeia in S\xE3o Paulo, designed by Lina Bo Bardi in a former
    factory, is one of the country's most used and studied cultural centers."
  _tradeOffs: "O custo maior n\xE3o \xE9 a obra, \xE9 a programa\xE7\xE3o e a manuten\xE7\xE3o
    de todos os anos."
  _tradeOffsEn: The biggest cost is not the building but the programming and upkeep
    every year.
